=== A1-b4: Active decision/spec/task context follows deterministic precedence ===
POLICY_PRECEDENCE.yaml layers:
layers:
  - constitution_hard_invariants
  - security_and_authority_policy
  - framework_kernel_policy
  - project_policy_overrides_and_exceptions
  - active_decisions_and_specifications
  - task_contracts_and_mutation_manifests
  - retrieved_or_inferred_context
# Keys without a matching rule are NOT overridable (deny by default).
default_mode: immutable
Default mode: default_mode: immutable

